{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-9-11","kind":"proposition","title":"大小比较：连比例与比例与整数","englishTitle":"If as many numbers as we please beginning from an unit be in continued proportion, the less measures the greater according to some one of the numbers which have place among the proportional numbers.","book":9,"number":11,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.11","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.11/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":11,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-9-11@raw-446d464fbd162cba","contentId":"euclid-9-11","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"446d464fbd162cbaf2eb147a089962893d6b28a0e8395c2b4a6784bb92e5f890","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-9-11.statement","euclid-9-11.construction.1","euclid-9-11.proof.1","euclid-9-11.proof.2","euclid-9-11.proof.3","euclid-9-11.conclusion","euclid-9-11.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-9-11.statement","contentId":"euclid-9-11","revisionId":"euclid-9-11@raw-446d464fbd162cba","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b16dd5df2d1ad83fca8dab7799572669b3e5101efef8a25f1be812cca9b3600f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If as many numbers as we please beginning from an unit be in continued proportion, the less measures the greater according to some one of the numbers which have place among the proportional numbers."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果从单位开始的连比例个数字中,数量越小,整除个数字中,数量越大,而成比例个数字中有一个数字中的数字。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-11.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-9-11","revisionId":"euclid-9-11@raw-446d464fbd162cba","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"30dfc988e9df145c93ebcc8a17a85b109ad182b1813f5561671ed802a9a2f95c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let there be as many numbers as we please, B, C, D, E, beginning from the unit A and in continued proportion; I say that B, the least of the numbers B, C, D, E, measures E according to some one of the numbers C, D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"请尽量多地提供B、C、D、D、E,从单位、A和连比例开始;我说,根据C、D、D、整除、连比例中的某些数字,其中最少的B数字是B、C、E、整除个。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-11.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-9-11","revisionId":"euclid-9-11@raw-446d464fbd162cba","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c6a00c69101ec55cdb6c5250a84e3ff7a3300b15e93b9d0c5807b39c6b6a9440","citations":["euclid-7-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For since, as the unit A is to B, so is D to E, therefore the unit A measures the number B the same number of times as D measures E; therefore, alternately, the unit A measures D the same number of times as B measures E. [[VII. 15](/principles/euclid-7-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"自那时以来,单位 A对B的比等于D对E的比,因此,单位 A 整除对B的数字是D 整除 E的相同次数;因此,单位 A 整除 D对E的数字是B 整除对E的相同次数。 [[VII. 15](/principles/euclid-7-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-11.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-9-11","revisionId":"euclid-9-11@raw-446d464fbd162cba","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fc23e044aa7232ebda4ed08404125a0c1db68098e7afd3e76828211c59aec905","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the unit A measures D according to the units in it; therefore B also measures E according to the units in D; so that B the less measures E the greater according to some number of those which have place among the proportional numbers.—"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,根据单位,单位,A,整除,D,D,B,单位,整除,E,单位;根据成比例数字中某些数字,B,整除,E,单位,整除,A。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-11.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-9-11","revisionId":"euclid-9-11@raw-446d464fbd162cba","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d7ee4989a1fb644e741e901c309140d0317025f516eded4c0c88d65b2fb42779","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Porism. And it is manifest that, whatever place the measuring number has, reckoned from the unit, the same place also has the number according to which it measures, reckoned from the number measured, in the direction of the number before it.—"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"坡力。很明显,无论整除数字从单位中计算到什么地方, 同一地方也拥有整除的数值, 也就是从整除的数字中测到的, 以及它面前的数字的方向。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-11.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-9-11","revisionId":"euclid-9-11@raw-446d464fbd162cba","order":5,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a767bacf26447ac75c1864eb85eb90c16406ee2f0184be6b8ee076c3e1a38d5c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-11.source","contentId":"euclid-9-11","revisionId":"euclid-9-11@raw-446d464fbd162cba","order":6,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0bb15f92cbc2376f03970d7dceb888f855a37ee9456ddbedc938de1f4df02f36","citations":[],"surfaces":[